 ['labs/the-durable-frame/index.html','Judge what the whole week makes possible.','For Tinius, useful strength must coexist with useful running. We track pacing, rhythm, leg effort and recovery across both. More exhaustion or bonus sets are not the objective. The current running progression and strength limits remain in place.']
