injectPanel('the-method.html',`<!-- ${marker} --><section class="form-observation-note" id="observation-led" aria-labelledby="observation-led-h"><p class="obs-label">PROGRESS</p><h2 id="observation-led-h">More useful running.<br>Not more suffering.</h2><p>I compare what you can do now with what the next challenge asks. I listen to how you find rhythm, hold the pace, restart and recover. Then I choose the work that moves you toward your goal.</p><p>One runner may need longer uninterrupted work. Another may need shorter pieces, a smaller week or a different cue. We use what happens to improve the next decision, not make everyone follow the same answer.</p><p>A hard session can be valuable. Its value is not how exhausted it leaves you. <a href="/labs/speed-that-endures/#rhythm-read">See the decision in practice</a>.</p></section>`);
